{
  "about": "Ask fox golden set: 20 analyst questions (Hebrew). `calls` are the tool calls an assistant should make; `checks` pin the figures and pages. Expected values were taken from the data independently of the server (pipeline outputs read directly: csm/summary.json, kpi.json, market.json, csm/capital.json, lens.json, peers/m/*.json, companies/*.json, restatements.json, calendar.json) and, where a figure is printed as is, confirmed on the cited page with document_page(find). Data as of 23.10.26 (regulator through 08/26, filings through Q2'26). Run: npm run eval.",
